     "time": "6:30-8am",
     "title": "Rowing*",
     "desc": "Get out on the smooth, glassy water of Fallen Leaf Lake. Rowers of all skill levels, come join us for a morning paddle. Be sure to sign up for a time in the sign-up book!"
    },
    {
     "time": "7-8am",
     "title": "Sunrise Yoga*",
     "desc": "The camp is quiet, the light is GOLDEN, and the Surya Namaskar is waiting. Sunrise Yoga is your excuse to drag yourself out of that sleeping bag and greet the day before anyone else does (with Prisha of course!). The sun is rising with or without you — don't make it rise alone!! Meet on the Crawdeck!"
    },
