     "time": "10am",
     "title": "Church Service",
     "desc": "The lovely Fallen Leaf Chapel is but a short walk from Camp, just over the bridge."
    },
    {
     "time": "10am-12pm",
     "title": "Tennis: Beginners Clinic*",
     "desc": "Never held a racket before? Not sure how to whip a Federer forehand? Rarely hitting your serves into that diagonal box that only seems to get smaller? Fear no more. In the Beginner Tennis Clinic, Robert will walk you through all the basics—the continental grip, proper footwork technique, basic technique and strategy. This clinic warmly welcomes all introductory skill levels, from years-rusty to never played before—this is your sign. Welcome to the sport you can play for life! Meet at the Tennis Courts! (USTA 1.5-2.5 recommended)"
    },
    {
     "time": "10-11:45am",
     "title": "Kids Groups",
     "desc": "Check out the \"Welcome to Microbopper Week, 2025\" sheet to find groups and drop-off locations —we've got a wonderful week in store!"
    },
    {
     "time": "10-11:45am",
     "title": "Ospreys"
    },
    {
     "time": "10am-2pm",
     "title": "Naturalist Hike*",
     "desc": "Join Isaiah for the chillest guided hike of the week! Expect 3-5 miles on trails you've hopefully never seen before, with plenty of time to soak in the views. As a geologist, Isaiah gives you the opportunity to gain deeper connections with the land by learning about its past and future. This hike is perfect for folks looking for an easier hike, wanting to see new things, or simply wanting to get outside and chat."
    },
    {
     "time": "10:30-11:30am",
     "title": "Faculty Speaker Lecture: Tiffany Steinwart, Cultivating Calm: Exploring Spiritual Wellness",
     "desc": "We could all use more calm amid life's chaos. This lecture offers both a scholarly and practical exploration of spirituality, aimed at holistic well-being. We will examine what spirituality looks like in many different forms, the benefits it can provide, and we will explore a range of contemplative practices for daily life in an effort to cultivate resilience, equanimity, and balance.",
     "special": true
    },
    {
     "time": "10:30am-12pm",
     "title": "Open Climb",
     "desc": "Come one, come all to the Sierra Camp rock wall! Whether you've never been climbing or you're Alex Honnold, Open Climb has a space for you. Join Mara at the rock wall and ASCEND! All you need is yourself, some clothes for moving (including closed-toed shoes), and plenty of water. Parents and older kids are invited, along with younger kids under parental supervision. Bring just yourself or the whole family to see Sierra Camp from a whole new angle!",
     "special": true
    }
   ],
