     "time": "1:15-4:15pm",
     "title": "Beginner Mountain Bike*",
     "desc": "Want to get a workout in, but don't want to go for a run? How about a spin? Do you need a bike for your on-the-go lifestyle? Then the beginner ride is just the ride for you! Anyone can do it! Come join Ethan for the first bike ride of the week. Packing list: water, sunscreen, and your commitment to having fun! Meet at the bottom of the lodge at 1:15pm. See ya there!"
    },
    {
     "time": "2-4pm",
     "title": "Ski Dock*",
