     "title": "Bread Bake*"
    },
    {
     "time": "2:30-4:30pm",
     "title": "Art: Mosaic Magic*",
     "desc": "Come join Andriana on the Old Lodge Deck for a hands-on mosaic session! We'll be working with colorful ceramic, and glass pieces to create your very own mosaic coaster. No experience needed, just bring clothes you don't mind getting a little dusty and your creative eye. Classical music, and calm, focused vibes guaranteed."
    },
    {
     "time": "3-4pm",
     "title": "Language Hour"
    },
    {
     "time": "3-4pm",
     "title": "Naturalist Boatster*",
     "desc": "Fallen Leaf Lake is the perfect stage to learn about the natural history of the Tahoe (dáɁaw) region. Join Sydney and Isaiah for a boatster cruise (with refreshments) and learn about the mountains, plants, and animals that make camp such a special place.",
     "special": true
    },
    {
     "time": "3-4pm",
     "title": "Volleyball Clinic",
     "desc": "Come meet at the volleyball courts at 3pm! This activity is for players of all levels who just want to play some games for fun—less for competition. We will be playing 4vs4 and 6vs6. Bring your own beverages for some fun relaxation on the courts and in the sun! Music will be provided for your soul food.",
     "special": true
    },
    {
     "time": "3-4:45pm",
     "title": "Beginner's Sailing*",
     "desc": "A little birdie told me you wanted to try out sailing! Cash will be at the boat dock to get you comfortable with the basics so you can start taking boats out on your own. You'll learn how to rig, use points of sail, and get some assisted lake practice. No sailing experience needed, just bring sunscreen, a swimsuit, and your biggest smile."
    },
    {
     "time": "3-4:45pm",
     "title": "Kids Groups",
     "desc": "MICROS AND MACROS: Micros, head to the Cathedral Room, and Macros, head to the Angora Room!\n\nGUPPIES C, D, & E: Guppies, ready for some afternoon activities? Meet in your respective Willow rooms ready to keep the fun going! Pick up at 4:45 is also in your Willow cabin. Guppies C and E will also be taking a ride on Boatster! All you need is some sunscreen, water, and your smiling selves!\n\nCRAWDADS C: Meet in Willow F and get ready for some afternoon fun! Pick up at 4:45 is also at Willow F. Clack clack!",
     "special": true
